<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-BOLDON WINS WORLD MEN'S 200 METRES TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-BOLDON WINS WORLD MEN'S 200 METRES TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinidadian Ato Boldon won the world men's 200 metres gold medal on Friday.</p>
<p>Frankie Fredericks of Namibia took the silver and Brazilian Claudinei da Silva the bronze.</p>
</text>
